sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as UI or API Docs
    participant API as FastAPI Adapter
    participant CM as New CodeManager
    participant Reader as Shared Source and ZIP Readers
    participant Registry as ProjectRegistry
    User->>UI: Select Python file or ZIP
    UI->>API: POST multipart file and optional projectName
    API->>CM: loadFile or loadZip with binary stream and filename
    CM->>Reader: Read bounded bytes and validate input
    Reader->>Reader: Check paths, metadata, eligibility, encoding
    alt Any eligible file fails
        Reader-->>CM: Domain error
        CM-->>API: Error without replacing project
        API-->>UI: Consistent JSON error and mapped status
    else Complete candidate is valid
        Reader-->>CM: Sorted original SourceFile list
        CM->>CM: Validate PyProject and assign project
        CM-->>API: List of SourceFile
        API->>CM: getProject()
        CM-->>API: PyProject
        API->>Registry: Atomic capacity check and register snapshot
        alt Registry full
            Registry-->>API: RegistryCapacityExceeded
            API-->>UI: HTTP 503 error, prior projects retained
        else Registered
            Registry-->>API: Registered
            API-->>UI: HTTP 201 project JSON
        end
    end
    Note over CM,Registry: Future coordinator passes getProject() to Harsha's analyzeProject outside CodeManager
